277	    /**
278	     * The owner's region, derived at response time from the {@code REGION} prefix of the
279	     * {@link #customerCode} (the segment before the first {@code '-'}). Because the customer code is
280	     * assigned as {@code <REGION>-<HASH8>} with REGION taken from the postcode, the locality follows
281	     * the same region-and-hash identity as the customer code. {@code UNKNOWN} when the owner has no
282	     * customer code.
283	     */
